---
layout: layouts/product.njk
title: "About"
description: "VoiceTel is a wholesale telecommunications and CPaaS provider focused on Programmable Voice, Voice Calling, messaging, SIP trunking, numbers, and operator support."
---
{%- from "partials/v2/macros.njk" import arrow %}
{%- set years %}{% yearsSince 1999 %}{% endset %}

<section class="hero hero--page" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
	<div class="hero__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
	<div class="container hero__inner">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Company</p>
			<h1 id="hero-heading">Wholesale communications for teams that need engineering depth.</h1>
			<p class="lede">VoiceTel builds and operates communications services for developers, telecom engineers, service providers, and businesses that need transparent pricing, practical migration paths, and support from people who understand the network.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/signup/">Free trial {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--secondary btn--lg" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__visual">
			{%- set kpis = [
				{ label: "In continuous operation", value: years, suffix: "years", sub: "Since 1999. Same company, same engineering culture, same operating philosophy." },
				{ label: "Colocation POPs", value: (site.pops | length), sub: (site.pops | join(" · ")) },
				{ label: "Cloud regions", value: (site.cloudRegions | length), sub: (site.cloudRegions | join(" · ")) },
				{ label: "Ownership", value: "Private", sub: "Privately held since 1999. No public-market obligations to redirect operating priorities." }
			] %}
			{% include "partials/v2/kpi-grid.njk" %}
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--tint" id="what" aria-labelledby="what-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="section__head">
			<p class="eyebrow">What VoiceTel does</p>
			<h2 id="what-heading">Programmable voice, wholesale network services, application messaging, and business calling.</h2>
			<p class="lede">VoiceTel has built networks for national carriers on a consultation basis. That engineering experience is embedded in every product we ship and every customer we support.</p>
		</div>
		{%- set features = [
			{ icon: "code-slash", title: "Programmable Voice", body: "<a href=\"/voiceml/\">VoiceML</a>-compatible call control, signed webhooks, recordings, conferences, queues, streams, and <a href=\"/voiceml/migrate/\">migration guidance</a>." },
			{ icon: "diagram-3", title: "Wholesale network services", body: "<a href=\"/voice/\">Voice</a> origination and termination, <a href=\"/sip-trunking/\">SIP trunking</a>, <a href=\"/numbers/\">numbers</a>, porting, emergency-service configuration, and caller identity services (<a href=\"/caller-lookup/\">Caller Lookup</a>, <a href=\"/carrier-lookup/\">Carrier Lookup</a>)." },
			{ icon: "chat-text", title: "Application messaging", body: "<a href=\"/messaging/\">SMS and MMS</a> transport with A2P 10DLC support, delivery visibility, and high-volume planning." },
			{ icon: "telephone-fill", title: "Business calling", body: "<a href=\"/pbx/\">Hosted PBX</a>, <a href=\"/phone/applications/\">VoiceTel Phone</a>, and <a href=\"/sdn/\">SDN appliance</a> options for organizations that want VoiceTel to operate more of the stack." }
		] %}
		{% include "partials/v2/feature-grid.njk" %}
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--white" id="company" aria-labelledby="company-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row row--reverse">
			<div class="row__text">
				<p class="eyebrow">Company</p>
				<h2 id="company-heading">A licensed carrier, incorporated in New Jersey in 1999.</h2>
				<p class="lede">United Internet Services d.b.a. VoiceTel was incorporated in the State of New Jersey in 1999. It is licensed with the FCC as a Non-Interconnected VoIP Provider and a Competitive Local Exchange Carrier (CLEC).</p>
				<p class="row__links">FCC Filer ID <a href="https://apps.fcc.gov/cgb/form499/499detail.cfm?FilerNum=829231">829231</a> &middot; Robocall Mitigation Database ID <a href="https://fccprod.servicenowservices.com/rmd">RMD0004909</a> &middot; OCN <strong>470J</strong>.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="row__visual">
				{%- set rows = [
					{ title: "FCC Form 499 filer", meta: "non-interconnected VoIP · ID 829231", state: "Registered" },
					{ title: "Competitive Local Exchange Carrier", meta: "OCN 470J", state: "Active" },
					{ title: "Robocall Mitigation Database", meta: "RMD0004909", state: "Registered" },
					{ title: "United Internet Services d.b.a. VoiceTel", meta: "incorporated in the State of New Jersey", state: "1999", neutral: true },
					{ title: "Privately held", meta: "no public-market obligations", state: years ~ " yrs", neutral: true }
				] %}
				{% include "partials/v2/status-card.njk" %}
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="cta-band">
			<div class="cta-band__text">
				<h3 class="cta-band__title">Connect with a Telecom Expert.</h3>
				<p class="cta-band__body">VoiceTel's experienced team is ready to help you navigate complex questions across voice, messaging, porting, service configuration, support, and carrier services.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="cta-band__actions cta-row">
				<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Contact VoiceTel {{ arrow(14) }}</a>
				<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="/signup/">Free trial</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

